=== A. The two conditions reduce to A^T B = 0 (symbolic, d = 3) ===
M^T omega M - (A^T B - B^T A) == 0: True
M^T eta   M - (A^T B + B^T A) == 0: True
(F_omega + F_eta)/2 - A^T B == 0:   True

