=== D. Explicit continuous family through a mixed coordinate splitting is exact (sympy, d = 2) ===
L(theta)^T omega L(theta) = [[0, 0], [0, 0]]   L(theta)^T eta L(theta) = [[0, 0], [0, 0]]
L(0) = span{x1, p2};  L(pi/2) = [[0, 1, 0, 0], [0, 0, -1, 0]] = span{x2, p1}

